.TH READV 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
readv \- read bytes into multiple buffers
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/uio.h>
.B ssize_t readv(int descriptor, const struct iovec* vectors, int count);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reads sequentially into the writable buffers described by the iovec array.
Each entry contains a void* iov_base and size_t iov_len. Reads may be short;
Linux validates the count and buffer addresses.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns bytes read, zero at EOF, or \-1 with errno set.
Success leaves errno unchanged.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR read (3crunch),
.BR readv (2)
